WEBVTT

00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:07.679
This video shows how to read the fee overview on your phone. It shows the state of your school's fees at a glance.

00:00:09.336 --> 00:00:17.400
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Fee Overview. The page opens on the current month.

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:26.575
At the top, choose Monthly or Annual. For the monthly view, pick the month and the year with the selectors below.

00:00:27.091 --> 00:00:32.467
Category-wise Collection shows how much of each fee category has been collected.

00:00:36.798 --> 00:00:42.126
The Collection Progress bar shows how much of the total due has been paid so far.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:51.392
Tap Collect Payments at the top to record payments. If the month shows nothing, generate the fee records first from Fee Setup.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:01:02.345
That is the fee overview. Check it each month to see how collection is going.
